  "prefLabel": "Crv 103.02 Responsibilities of the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Crv 103.02 Responsibilities of the Commission. The commission’s responsibilities include:\n\n(a) Assembling and publishing a comprehensive inventory of natural resources of the Connecticut River valley;\n\n(b) Coordinating a regional promotional program with the department of resources and economic development;\n\n(c) Providing for interstate cooperation with the state of Vermont;\n\n(d) Cooperating with local communities and regional planning commissions;\n\n(e) Reviewing and evaluating other river and watershed protection endeavors;\n\n(f) Seeking and expending additional public and private funds;\n\n(g) Encouraging the protection of agricultural, historical, and natural resources, and the provision of additional public access to recreational sites; and\n\n(h) Providing grants to further the purposes of the commission.\n\nSource. #7567, eff 9-28-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/crv100.html"
